# A block whose query fails at the document root, with the author's own message inside it.
#
# `Parameters` is absent, so the block's query resolves to nothing and the value it traversed to is the
# document -- whose path is empty. The reporter had no bucket for a finding with no path and no collector
# reached it either, because the one that handles blocks required `unresolved` to be absent and this shape
# is the one constructor that sets it. The run exited 19 saying "Number of non-compliant resources 0".
rule parameters_are_constrained {
    Parameters {
        Env exists  << Every template must constrain Env >>
    }
}
